cff-version: 1.2.0
title: NanoKMC
message: >-
  If you use NanoKMC in scientific work, please cite this software release.
  When the accompanying NanoKMC method paper is available, cite that paper as
  well when referring to the method or scientific results.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Prüfer
    given-names: Thomas
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-23
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  Single-core C++17 research software for lattice kinetic Monte Carlo of
  conserved nearest-neighbour exchange on periodic FCC lattices. NanoKMC
  provides six solver architectures spanning blind proposals, structural
  active-event filtering, partial filtering, coarse rate categories, and exact
  finite-rate classes. The release includes a validated homogeneous binary
  nearest-neighbour model and an extensible Active-Filtered local-environment
  backend for richer local physics and multi-species extensions.
keywords:
  - kinetic Monte Carlo
  - lattice kinetic Monte Carlo
  - Kawasaki dynamics
  - FCC lattice
  - active-event filtering
  - finite-rate classes
  - Monte Carlo
  - research software
  - reproducibility
